 "notes": "Libretto by Lorenzo Da Ponte (1787). Words as sung in the Schirmer vocal score, which the app follows where it differs from the libretto. Libretto: \"oddio!\" Libretto: \"ai voleri del ciel\". Donna Anna's \"in si tristi\" as printed, without the accent. \"Crudele!\" ends in the shared first bar of No. 23 (S56). Donna Anna's \"Ma il padre\" is printed \"Ma iì padre\", a misprint; it is sung \"il\". The last bar is shared with No. 23: its first word, Anna's \"Crudele?\", begins the next piece and is left out here.",
